WEBVTT

00:02.280 --> 00:08.240
Your Majesty this is news from Qing Province Xie Xuan is implementing reforms there it has sparked a popular uprising.

00:08.320 --> 00:11.613
The gentry nearly turned the provincial capital upside down.

00:16.560 --> 00:22.280
This infuriates me back when Yiyang was besieged our volunteer army risked life and death for Your Majesty.

00:22.360 --> 00:28.280
Only a few old brothers survived I don't believe Your Majesty would abandon us right let's go.

00:28.360 --> 00:33.413
Come with me to the capital to see His Majesty to the capital to see His Majesty to the capital to see His Majesty.

00:38.400 --> 00:42.480
Unfilial son you kneel down.

00:45.480 --> 00:50.400
The sages' books are for reading not for you to actually use.

00:52.600 --> 00:56.267
His Majesty sent you to reform in the Chen family's stronghold.

00:56.440 --> 00:59.640
Can't you see the pattern?

01:06.360 --> 01:11.640
To achieve great things there must be sacrifices to achieve great things.

01:12.240 --> 01:15.400
There must be sacrifices it's unavoidable.

01:16.400 --> 01:17.800
This is what.

01:19.560 --> 01:21.200
Father taught me.

01:23.320 --> 01:26.107
Your Majesty Chancellor Xie requests an audience.

01:33.920 --> 01:35.320
Summon him.

01:39.120 --> 01:44.200
Your Majesty the reforms cannot continue in Qing Province, nobles are intertwined with nobles.

01:44.280 --> 01:48.560
Personal connections are layered if we continue reforming it's no longer something Xie Xuan.

01:48.640 --> 01:51.280
Can handle.

01:52.600 --> 01:55.560
Your servant begs Your Majesty to revoke the order.

01:55.640 --> 01:59.320
Don't let Xie Xuan wade into this muddy water anymore.

02:00.800 --> 02:06.240
Your servant has already lost a daughter now only this one son remains.

02:09.120 --> 02:14.360
Your Majesty Your Majesty, this old servant begs you, Your Majesty.

